flowchart TD
    A["Esqueleto:<br/>∫ arcsin(x) dx = x·arcsin(x) + √(1 − x²) + C"]
    P1["u = arcsin(x), dv = dx<br/>du = dx/√(1 − x²), v = x"]
    I1["x·arcsin(x) − ∫ x/√(1 − x²) dx"]
    I2["∫ x·(1 − x²)^(−1/2) dx<br/>tiene antiderivada simple:<br/>−√(1 − x²)"]
    R["x·arcsin(x) − (−√(1 − x²)) + C<br/>= x·arcsin(x) + √(1 − x²) + C"]
    OK["Verificación por derivada:<br/>d/dx [x·arcsin(x) + √(1 − x²)] = arcsin(x)"]
    A --> P1
    P1 --> I1
    I1 --> I2
    I2 --> R
    R --> OK

